// How far any rotation of any structure-piece template's box can reach
// from the source chunk's minimum corner: 47 west, 47 east,
// 47 north, 47 south. With 16-block chunks that is 3
// chunk(s) away at most, so a start can only touch chunks within that
// distance of its source.
inline constexpr int32_t kWgPieceChunkReach = 3;

